---
source: tui/src/keymap_setup.rs
expression: snapshot
---
Focus Main Composer | leader c (ctrl-x c) | Global focus_main_composer Focus Main Composer Focus the main conversation composer. leader c (ctrl-x c) Default
Focus Sidebar Tabs | leader t (ctrl-x t) | Global focus_sidebar_tabs Focus Sidebar Tabs Open the sidebar tab chooser. leader t (ctrl-x t) Default
Focus Sidebar Content | leader s (ctrl-x s) | Global focus_sidebar_content Focus Sidebar Content Focus the side conversation, or hide it when already focused. leader s (ctrl-x s) Default
Hide Pane | leader - (ctrl-x -) | Global hide_pane Hide Pane Hide the focused sidebar pane. leader - (ctrl-x -) Default
Focus Pane Left | leader left (ctrl-x left), leader h (ctrl-x h) | Global focus_pane_left Focus Pane Left Focus the parent conversation. leader left (ctrl-x left), leader h (ctrl-x h) Default
Focus Pane Right | leader right (ctrl-x right), leader l (ctrl-x l) | Global focus_pane_right Focus Pane Right Focus the open side conversation. leader right (ctrl-x right), leader l (ctrl-x l) Default
Minimize Pane Width | leader , (ctrl-x ,) | Global minimize_pane_width Minimize Pane Width Minimize the focused pane width. leader , (ctrl-x ,) Default
Maximize Pane Width | leader . (ctrl-x .) | Global maximize_pane_width Maximize Pane Width Maximize the focused pane width. leader . (ctrl-x .) Default
Equalize Pane Widths | leader = (ctrl-x =) | Global equalize_pane_widths Equalize Pane Widths Equalize visible pane widths. leader = (ctrl-x =) Default
Resize Panes | leader r (ctrl-x r) | Global resize_panes Resize Panes Enter keyboard resize mode for visible dividers. leader r (ctrl-x r) Default
Move Divider Left | leader shift-h (ctrl-x shift-h) | Global move_divider_left Move Divider Left Move the divider left when the side pane has focus. leader shift-h (ctrl-x shift-h) Default
Move Divider Right | leader shift-l (ctrl-x shift-l) | Global move_divider_right Move Divider Right Move the divider right when the side pane has focus. leader shift-l (ctrl-x shift-l) Default
Toggle Pane Zoom | leader z (ctrl-x z) | Global toggle_pane_zoom Toggle Pane Zoom Zoom or restore the focused pane. leader z (ctrl-x z) Default
